---
// Component Script (JavaScript)
const {
  title = "ForestAI: An AI-Powered Platform for Enhanced Forest Resource Assessment and Health Monitoring",
  description = "Introducing an innovative platform leveraging artificial intelligence for automated forest assessment, monitoring and projection of forest resources and health conditions.",
  pubDate = "2025-04-05",
  heroImage = "/blog/forestai-hero.jpg",
  tags = ["AI", "Forest Monitoring", "Sustainability"]
} = Astro.props;

const formattedDate = new Date(pubDate).toLocaleDateString('en-US', {
  year: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  day: 'numeric'
});
---

<div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8 max-w-5xl">
  <header class="text-center mb-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-green-800 mb-4">{title}</h1>
    <div class="flex justify-center mt-6">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">{formattedDate}</p>
    </div>
    {tags.length > 0 && (
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mt-4">
        {tags.map((tag) => (
          <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-green-100 text-green-800 text-sm rounded-full">{tag}</span>
        ))}
      </div>
    )}
  </header>

  <section class="bg-amber-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md mb-10">
    <p class="mb-4">
      In the southeastern United States, known as the wood basket of the nation, 70% of U.S. reforestation occurs, producing over 25% of the world's pulpwood and 18% of its saw timber, so advanced forest monitoring tools are increasingly critical in this region. To address this need, we developed ForestAI, a web-based platform leveraging artificial intelligence to enhance automated assessment, monitoring and projection of forest resources and health conditions.
    </p>
  </section>

    <section class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-green-700 mb-4">Priorities, Pilots, and Goals</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Current research priorities include validating the platform's effectiveness with existing data sources and real-world applications, particularly for early detection of pests and diseases. Future development will focus on integrating emerging technologies, high-resolution satellite imagery and structural measurements and advanced drone observations, to improve scalability. This research contributes to modernizing forest monitoring, data analytics, and decision-making support in the southeastern U.S., to enhance forest productivity and resilience while maintaining high standards of accuracy in resource assessment.
      </p>
    </section>


  <section class="bg-white p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md mb-10">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-green-700 mb-4">Species Distribution Model Workflow: Oak Wilt Disease Pilot Study</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Our pilot study focuses on Oak Wilt disease detection and prediction, demonstrating the platform's capabilities for forest health monitoring.
    </p>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-6">
      <div class="bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2">Data Acquisition & Processing</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Climate Data Collection → Process Climate Variables</li>
          <li>Oak Wilt Data → Prepare Reference Dataset</li>
          <li>Split Training & Testing Data</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">Predictive Modeling</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>XGBoost</li>
          <li>Random Forest</li>
          <li>SVM</li>
          <li>Neural Network</li>
          <li>Model Evaluation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      
      <div class="bg-amber-50 p-4 rounded-lg">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-800 mb-2">Prediction & Validation</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-2">
          <li>Generate Oak Wilt Risk Predictions</li>
          <li>Generate Risk Maps and Reports</li>
          <li>Validate with Field Observations</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    

      <div>
        <img src="/public/images/oak-wilt-distribution.jpg" alt="Distribution of Oak Wilt Observations in Southeastern United States" class="rounded-lg shadow-sm w-full" />
      </div>
    
  </section>

  <section class="bg-green-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-md">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-green-700">Interactive Demo</h2>
      <div class="flex space-x-2">
        <button class="p-2 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-gray-100">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8.684 13.342C8.886 12.938 9 12.482 9 12c0-.482-.114-.938-.316-1.342m0 2.684a3 3 0 110-2.684m0 2.684l6.632 3.316m-6.632-6l6.632-3.316m0 0a3 3 0 105.367-2.684 3 3 0 00-5.367 2.684zm0 9.316a3 3 0 105.368 2.684 3 3 0 00-5.368-2.684z" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        <button class="p-2 rounded-full bg-white hover:bg-gray-100">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 text-gray-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h10a8 8 0 018 8v2M3 10l6 6m-6-6l6-6" />
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="w-full p-4 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-inner">
      <div id="forestai-demo" class="py-8">
        <div class="text-center">
          <button id="load-demo" class="bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white font-bold py-2 px-4 rounded transition">
            Load Interactive Demo
          </button>
        </div>
        
        <div id="demo-content" class="hidden mt-6">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">Forest Health Overview</h3>
              <div class="h-64 w-full bg-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                <div class="donut-chart-placeholder w-40 h-40 rounded-full border-8 border-green-500 relative">
                  <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
                    <div class="text-center">
                      <div class="text-xl font-bold text-green-700">75%</div>
                      <div class="text-sm text-gray-600">Healthy</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg">
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">Disease Distribution</h3>
              <div class="h-64 w-full bg-white rounded-lg p-4">
                <div class="h-full w-full flex flex-col justify-between">
                  <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                    <div class="bg-green-100 p-2 rounded text-center">
                      <div class="font-bold">Healthy</div>
                      <div>75%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-yellow-100 p-2 rounded text-center">
                      <div class="font-bold">At Risk</div>
                      <div>15%</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-red-100 p-2 rounded text-center">
                      <div class="font-bold">Infected</div>
                      <div>10%</div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  
                  <div class="relative h-10 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-green-500" style="width: 75%"></div>
                    <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-yellow-500 ml-[75%]" style="width: 15%"></div>
                    <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-full bg-red-500 ml-[90%]" style="width: 10%"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="mt-6 bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg">
            <h3 class="font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2">Health Trends</h3>
            <div class="h-64 w-full bg-white rounded-lg p-4">
              <div class="h-full w-full flex items-end justify-between">
                <div class="relative w-full h-full">
                  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full border-t border-gray-300"></div>
                  <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 left-0 w-full border-t border-gray-200 border-dashed"></div>
                  <div class="absolute bottom-2/4 left-0 w-full border-t border-gray-200 border-dashed"></div>
                  <div class="absolute bottom-3/4 left-0 w-full border-t border-gray-200 border-dashed"></div>
                  
                  <div class="h-full w-full flex items-end justify-between">
                    <div class="h-[70%] w-8 bg-green-500 rounded-t"></div>
                    <div class="h-[75%] w-8 bg-green-500 rounded-t"></div>
                    <div class="h-[65%] w-8 bg-green-500 rounded-t"></div>
                    <div class="h-[80%] w-8 bg-green-500 rounded-t"></div>
                    <div class="h-[78%] w-8 bg-green-500 rounded-t"></div>
                    <div class="h-[82%] w-8 bg-green-500 rounded-t"></div>
                    <div class="h-[75%] w-8 bg-green-500 rounded-t"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const loadDemoButton = document.getElementById('load-demo');
    const demoContent = document.getElementById('demo-content');
    
    if (loadDemoButton && demoContent) {
      loadDemoButton.addEventListener('click', () => {
        demoContent.classList.toggle('hidden');
        if (!demoContent.classList.contains('hidden')) {
          loadDemoButton.textContent = 'Hide Demo';
        } else {
          loadDemoButton.textContent = 'Load Interactive Demo';
        }
      });
    }
  });
</script>